{
  "summary": "This experiment tested RNA-only multiprofile models with avgpool aggregation, achieving 59.1% validation accuracy (vs. 48.5% for singleprofile RNA-only baseline). The result suggests multiprofile settings may improve RNA-only performance, though uncertainty remains about whether this improvement stems from profile settings alone or interactions with aggregation methods. No direct comparison to alternative aggregators was conducted."
}

